# The Wild Area: wide open moorland between the towns, Pokémon of every kind roaming it; the pipes' drones on A
# and E under a tin whistle's long tune in A mixolydian, a string orchestra rising behind it and a slow bodhrán;
# at night a flute and a quieter orchestra.
